NOTICE — AUTHORIZED SECURITY TESTING ONLY

This software orchestrates active security testing against network targets.
By installing or running it you represent that every target you point it at
is covered by a written authorization (bug bounty program scope or signed
pentest contract) and that you are the authorized tester. All target-facing
traffic is routed through Burp Suite so scope, rate limits and audit trails
are enforced outside this codebase as well; the account vault, reporting
helpers and solver integrations must only be used within that authorization.
